<title>UK: Chubb's Jones joins Hiscox.</title>
<headline>Chubb's Jones joins Hiscox.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ralph E Jones has resigned as president and chief underwriting officer of Chubb Insurance Company of Europe SA (CICE) to join Lloyd's of London insurer Hiscox Plc.</p>
<p>Jones is leaving Chubb after 19 years to become managing director of Hiscox Insurance Company Ltd and Hiscox Underwriting Ltd, CICE said in a statement on Monday.</p>
<p>CICE chairman John Cavoores said Jones' position will not be filled.</p>
<p>CICE is a part of Chubb Corp of the U.S.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Insurance News +44 171 542 2769</p>
